            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nThis is [explicitly out of scope](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/009435c6c3653d54bc62997ca6b2e8513bc52cf4/doc/mini-files.txt#L35-L37) for 'mini.files' itself. There are all means that should be necessary to do so, as mentioned in the link. The main issue here would be to efficiently get the information about all present errors/diagnostics in the directory, though.\n\nClosing as not planned.",
